Package: ggchord
Title: Layered Chord, Circular and Linear Sequence Visualization
Version: 0.27.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Jem", family = "Dang", email = "dangjem0730@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'ggplot2'-based package for multi-sequence alignment chord
    diagrams, linear and radial synteny plots, HSP dotplots and single circular
    sequence maps and static cross-panel interval compositions.
    A layered grammar combines
    sequence backbones, interval links, genes, general biological features,
    labels, quantitative tracks, genomic axes and restriction sites. Feature
    placement is expressed with reusable Position objects, while role-specific
    scales and themes keep data mapping separate from geometry and appearance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0), grDevices, grid, rlang, scales, utils
